Package: BiocKube
Title: Run BiocParallel Workers and BiocJobs on Kubernetes
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alexandru", "Mahmoud", email = "almahmoudresearch@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3779-492X"))
Description: Dispatches work from an R session to a Kubernetes cluster.
    KubeParam is a BiocParallel backend whose workers run as pods, so
    bplapply() and related functions evaluate on the cluster. submitJob()
    runs jobs declared with BiocJobs as Kubernetes Jobs, uploading local
    inputs and downloading outputs. The R session needs only API access to
    the cluster; pods never connect back to it.
